        'description' => 'FSSAI full form is Food Safety and Standards Authority of India. See what FSSAI does, the 3 licence types, who needs one and how long approval takes.',
        'answer' => '<p><strong>FSSAI full form is Food Safety and Standards Authority of India.</strong> It is the statutory body under the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare that sets food standards and registers or licenses every food business in India, under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.</p>',
        'top' => [
            ['FSSAI full form in English, Hindi and Marathi', '<table><thead><tr><th>Language</th><th>Full form of FSSAI</th></tr></thead><tbody>
