<li><strong>Digits 2–3:</strong> the state code.</li>
<li><strong>Digits 4–5:</strong> the year of issue.</li>
<li><strong>Digits 6–8:</strong> the number of the issuing licensing or registering authority.</li>
<li><strong>Digits 9–14:</strong> the food business operator’s own number.</li>
