        'description' => 'Find the right NIC code: 2-digit section list, common codes for import-export, trading, services and manufacturing, and how to pick codes for Udyam.',
        'answer' => '<p><strong>NIC (National Industrial Classification) codes classify business activity in India.</strong> Udyam registration asks you to pick each activity at the 2-, 4- and 5-digit levels of NIC 2008. The tables below list the 2-digit divisions and the codes most traders, exporters and service businesses use.</p>',
