            ['NIC code for import-export business', '<p>There is no single “import-export” code. Pick the code for what you actually trade or do; Udyam then shows the 5-digit sub-classes under each 4-digit class.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Activity</th><th>NIC 2008 class</th></tr></thead><tbody>
