<tr><td>Customs broker or freight forwarder</td><td>5229 – Other transportation support activities</td></tr>
</tbody></table><p>An exporter that makes its own goods should choose the manufacturing code (division 10 to 33) for the product instead. You will also need an <a href="/services/indian-registration-compliances/import-export/import-export-code-iec">Import Export Code (IEC)</a>.</p>'],
            ['NIC code for trading (wholesale and retail)', '<p>Wholesale trade is division 46 and retail trade is division 47. Common retail codes:</p><ul>
