<li><strong>4791</strong> – retail via mail order houses or the internet (online sellers)</li>
</ul><p>Retail and wholesale traders can register on Udyam, but only for priority sector lending, not for the other MSME benefits.</p>'],
            ['NIC code for services', '<table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>NIC 2008 class</th></tr></thead><tbody>
