        'faqs' => [
            ['What is the NIC code for an import-export business?', 'There is no single code. A merchant exporter or importer usually chooses 4690 (non-specialised wholesale trade) or the wholesale class for the goods traded, such as 4630 for food. A manufacturer-exporter uses the manufacturing code for its product.'],
            ['Which NIC code is used for trading?', 'Wholesale trade uses division 46 (for example 4690 or a product-specific class) and retail trade uses division 47 (for example 4711 for grocery stores or 4791 for online selling). Choose the 5-digit sub-class that matches what you sell.'],
